---
---

<section class="hero-section">
  <div class="hero-badge-row">
    <div class="pill-badge live">
      <span class="pulse-dot"></span>
      <span>Kerala, India</span>
    </div>
    <div class="pill-badge">
      <span>Linux · Rust · Wayland</span>
    </div>
    <div class="pill-badge">
      <span>Building in the open</span>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="hero-main">
    <h1 class="hero-title text-large-title">
      Amal Raj
    </h1>

    <p class="hero-tagline text-headline">
      Tinkering with systems, Rust, and lean desktop tools on Linux.
    </p>

    <p class="hero-bio text-body">
      I grew up on hardware where every megabyte and background process mattered. When I find software that feels sluggish, bloated, or rough around the edges, I usually sit down and vibe code my own version—building native Wayland utilities and CLI tools that look clean, feel fast, and respect your machine.
    </p>

    <div class="hero-cta-group">
      <a href="#projects" class="button-primary">
        <span>View Projects</span>
        <svg width="15" height="15" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
          <polyline points="6 9 12 15 18 9"></polyline>
        </svg>
      </a>

      <a href="#writing" class="button-secondary">
        <svg width="15" height="15" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
          <path d="M4 19.5v-15A2.5 2.5 0 0 1 6.5 2H20v20H6.5a2.5 2.5 0 0 1-2.5-2.5Z"></path>
          <path d="M6 6h10"></path>
          <path d="M6 10h10"></path>
        </svg>
        <span>Devlogs & Notes</span>
      </a>

      <a href="#about" class="button-glass">
        <span>About & Ethos</span>
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .hero-section {
    padding: var(--space-12) 0 var(--space-8);
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: flex-start;
    gap: var(--space-4);
  }

  .hero-badge-row {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: var(--space-2);
    flex-wrap: wrap;
  }

  .pulse-dot {
    width: 6px;
    height: 6px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background-color: var(--accent-green);
    display: inline-block;
  }

  .hero-main {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: var(--space-3);
    max-width: 680px;
  }

  .hero-title {
    color: var(--text-primary);
    font-size: clamp(34px, 5vw, 42px);
    line-height: 1.15;
    margin-top: var(--space-1);
    letter-spacing: -0.5px;
  }

  .hero-tagline {
    color: var(--text-primary);
    font-weight: 500;
    font-size: 19px;
    line-height: 27px;
    letter-spacing: -0.2px;
  }

  .hero-bio {
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    font-size: 16px;
    line-height: 26px;
    margin-top: 2px;
  }

  .hero-cta-group {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: var(--space-3);
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    margin-top: var(--space-4);
  }

  .button-primary {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: var(--space-2);
    min-height: 42px;
    padding: 0 18px;
    background: var(--accent-blue);
    color: #ffffff;
    font-size: 14px;
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: -0.2px;
    border-radius: var(--radius-pill);
    box-shadow: 0 4px 14px -2px rgba(10, 132, 255, 0.4);
    transition: transform var(--spring-micro), background var(--spring-micro);
  }

  .button-primary:hover {
    background: #0077ed;
    transform: translateY(-1px);
  }

  .button-primary:active {
    transform: scale(0.98);
  }

  .button-secondary {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: var(--space-2);
    min-height: 42px;
    padding: 0 16px;
    background: rgba(10, 132, 255, 0.1);
    color: #0a84ff;
    font-size: 14px;
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: -0.2px;
    border-radius: var(--radius-pill);
    border: 1px solid rgba(10, 132, 255, 0.22);
    transition: transform var(--spring-micro), background var(--spring-micro);
  }

  .button-secondary:hover {
    background: rgba(10, 132, 255, 0.18);
    transform: translateY(-1px);
  }

  .button-secondary:active {
    transform: scale(0.98);
  }

  .button-glass {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    min-height: 42px;
    padding: 0 16px;
    background: var(--surface-1);
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    font-size: 14px;
    font-weight: 500;
    letter-spacing: -0.2px;
    border-radius: var(--radius-pill);
    border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);
    box-shadow: var(--glass-inner-shadow);
    transition: transform var(--spring-micro), color var(--spring-micro), background var(--spring-micro);
  }

  .button-glass:hover {
    color: var(--text-primary);
    background: var(--surface-2);
    transform: translateY(-1px);
  }

  .button-glass:active {
    transform: scale(0.98);
  }
</style>
